(7652999, 1245221, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great idea and composite image. The breaking away scene however gives the impression of a concrete shoreline (is it? or is it a flat beach?), would have preferred a real nature feel to it.</td>', 'Great idea and composite image. The breaking away scene however gives the impression of a concrete shoreline (is it? or is it a flat beach?), would have preferred a real nature feel to it.', '2020-02-08 05:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7653000, 1245479, 4008, '<td valign="top">puts a smile on my face. I like it. What kind of processing is this? It feels like the people are a bit separated from the street, showing some edges around them. Is that the effect of cut/paste or sharpening?</td>', 'puts a smile on my face. I like it. What kind of processing is this? It feels like the people are a bit separated from the street, showing some edges around them. Is that the effect of cut/paste or sharpening?', '2020-02-08 05:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
