(7653570, 1245481, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s quite some processing done, from a dull average image to an attractive image you can hang on the wall. Great job. (and about the kickstand shadow: it should run 45 degrees up and to the left to make it look real, to the point where the shadow of the middle of the bike is, because that is where it is attached ;-) )</td>', 'Wow, that''s quite some processing done, from a dull average image to an attractive image you can hang on the wall. Great job. (and about the kickstand shadow: it should run 45 degrees up and to the left to make it look real, to the point where the shadow of the middle of the bike is, because that is where it is attached ;-) )', '2020-02-14 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 0),
