(7653579, 1245433, 124729, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> not quite buying the light from the window. something about the intensity and direction of it doesn''t feel right. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It''s a very very very strong light bulb :-P<br/>Jokes apart, I did it on a purpose, expecially to give a more "fantasy" look to the picture. What I do not understand is how some submissions totally "not extended" can be "rewarded" by the voters in these kind of contests... ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-02-14 09:10:59.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: not quite buying the light from the window. something about the intensity and direction of it doesn''t feel right.  It''s a very very very strong light bulb :-PJokes apart, I did it on a purpose, expecially to give a more "fantasy" look to the picture. What I do not understand is how some submissions totally "not extended" can be "rewarded" by the voters in these kind of contests... ;-)', '2020-02-14 09:10:17.000000', '2020-02-14 09:10:59.000000', 0),
