(7653588, 1245525, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> The top right image deviates from the total set because of the rotation. Better without? Not sure. </i></td></tr></table> that''s just not true. it''s just another angle. some of the shots are from directly overhead, and the macro is also a deviation. This is a great grouping.</td>', 'Originally posted by willem: The top right image deviates from the total set because of the rotation. Better without? Not sure.  that''s just not true. it''s just another angle. some of the shots are from directly overhead, and the macro is also a deviation. This is a great grouping.', '2020-02-14 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7653589, 1245520, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> In my view this a quite a standard shot that relies on the post processing to make it special. Does not do it for me. </i></td></tr></table> I guess he lives in Avalon with Arthur and Queen Mab.</td>', 'Originally posted by willem: In my view this a quite a standard shot that relies on the post processing to make it special. Does not do it for me.  I guess he lives in Avalon with Arthur and Queen Mab.', '2020-02-14 10:25:36.000000', NULL, 0),
