(7653612, 1245473, 47974, '<td valign="top">I want to thank everyone for all the comments, it really means a lot.  I normally respond to everyone but I work up this morning with a 101.7 temperature, so don''t have any energy.  It is almost 4pm here and this is the first time I have gotten out of bed.<br/> <br/>I am super excited because I have been trying to get a Blue Ribbon in a free study for a lot time now.  To do it with an image that has barely any editing in a best of a year extended editing challenge makes it all that better.<br/> <br/>If anyone is interested in the full story behind this photo (plus other photos) you can find it <a href="https://www.mu-43.com/threads/gorgeous-is-foxy.106606/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here.</a> <br/> <br/>You can also find the story behind The King photo <a href="https://www.mu-43.com/threads/when-things-work-out.107122/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here.</a> <br/> <br/>Now back to bed.<br/> <br/>Ronnie<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-02-14 19:52:47.</i></td>', 'I want to thank everyone for all the comments, it really means a lot.  I normally respond to everyone but I work up this morning with a 101.7 temperature, so don''t have any energy.  It is almost 4pm here and this is the first time I have gotten out of bed. I am super excited because I have been trying to get a Blue Ribbon in a free study for a lot time now.  To do it with an image that has barely any editing in a best of a year extended editing challenge makes it all that better. If anyone is interested in the full story behind this photo (plus other photos) you can find it here.  You can also find the story behind The King photo here.  Now back to bed. Ronnie', '2020-02-14 19:52:18.000000', '2020-02-14 19:52:47.000000', 0),
(7653637, 1245525, 16148, '<td valign="top">I''ve been quiet on here but popped in for a look.  I was pleasantly surprised to find this in the top 10.  You know I''m a sucker for photo collections.  A wonderful mix of geometric and organic shapes.  The smily face, lower right, is placed perfectly.  Terrific!</td>', 'I''ve been quiet on here but popped in for a look.  I was pleasantly surprised to find this in the top 10.  You know I''m a sucker for photo collections.  A wonderful mix of geometric and organic shapes.  The smily face, lower right, is placed perfectly.  Terrific!', '2020-02-15 07:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
