(7653715, 1245372, 98565, '<td valign="top">I didn''t suspect the loon to be assembled into your shot, totally believable. You did a great job on the shadow/reflection - that''s why mostly you could tell it''s not real.<br/>I also like the thin light line between mountain and reflection<br/>As a whole I liked it but I wasn''t overwhelmed - it didn''t  feel like a best of shot - Extended or not.<br/> <br/>edit:<br/>sorry left a "n"<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-02-16 17:31:37.</i></td>', 'I didn''t suspect the loon to be assembled into your shot, totally believable. You did a great job on the shadow/reflection - that''s why mostly you could tell it''s not real.I also like the thin light line between mountain and reflectionAs a whole I liked it but I wasn''t overwhelmed - it didn''t  feel like a best of shot - Extended or not. edit:sorry left a "n"', '2020-02-16 17:29:26.000000', '2020-02-16 17:31:37.000000', 0),
